margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.93%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.52%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.68%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3.6pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_lUBxT6nrc0K-Jp4BGPCVnA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AccruedLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_lnDEOhmQkUmn4ZejJesY4w_10_3">6,369</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.93%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.52%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.68%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3.6pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_IOD0b39AhEuYau4_QptbMQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AccruedLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_mHGyappFnkCEM2rqN93NfA_10_6">5,398</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_Hlk116894649"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_tofE_XZPmUi1m7ytubGWZQ" name="us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_GMHC6IylYEaKq3mwgUUPHw" continuedAt="Tb_GMHC6IylYEaKq3mwgUUPHw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;">4. Debt</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Innovatus Loan Agreement</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">On October 31, 2022, the Company entered into a Loan and Security Agreement (the &#8220;Loan Agreement&#8221;) with Innovatus Life Sciences Fund I, LP, as the collateral agent and a lender, under which the Company may borrow, subject to the Company&#8217;s achievement of certain milestones, up to a total of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_cvrx_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_7vW7J_Y6BUuPDKRDIyMSTw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_7S2LUm2Meki39R25ewGsaw">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million in a series of term loans. On the closing date, the Company borrowed the minimum amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_cvrx_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_bqvgN4SX6k6fVbhuMCxuKA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_xxNeHTeTF0KG6GClk63SoA">7.5</ix:nonFraction> million under the Loan Agreement. The Loan Agreement initially requires interest only payments through November 2027, followed by <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_HbnPjirLTkGMI5uhWEqjvA;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three</span></span> monthly principal and interest payments. A final payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_cvrx_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_7vW7J_Y6BUuPDKRDIyMSTw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="cvrx:DebtInstrumentFinalPayment" scale="6" id="Narr_0PhuFvmAW0CXSbqp6Nr48g">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million, equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_McnxRzCZsEioKvH21AiUWA" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_cvrx_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_7vW7J_Y6BUuPDKRDIyMSTw" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="cvrx:DebtInstrumentPercentageOfFinalPaymentOnOriginalPrincipal" scale="-2" id="Narr_yzUfqbvBDEODo5oL_ZyXJw">4.5</ix:nonFraction>% of the original borrowed principal, is due in January 2028. The terms loans advanced pursuant to the Loan Agreement (collectively, the &#8220;Term Loans&#8221;) bear interest at a floating rate per annum equal to the sum of (a)&#160;the greater of (i) the prime rate and (ii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_McnxRzCZsEioKvH21AiUWA" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_cvrx_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_bqvgN4SX6k6fVbhuMCxuKA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_8679_ZZ380atDcEcoWjcYA">5.50</ix:nonFraction>% plus (b)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_McnxRzCZsEioKvH21AiUWA" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_cvrx_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_bqvgN4SX6k6fVbhuMCxuKA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateDuringPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_Tl6oreR8k0Wfa26tQRoEWQ">2.65</ix:nonFraction>%. The Term Loans mature on January 31, 2028 and require interest-only payments until November&#160;1, 2027. The Term Loans are secured by substantially all of the personal property of the Company. The Company has the option to draw down (i)&#160;the remaining $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_cvrx_LineOfCreditDrawDownPeriodOneMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_L2QONpn8iEado68EUYKiaQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_DncSrhsB_0mdk6G4xbndYQ">7.5</ix:nonFraction> million of the first tranche from the filing date of the Company&#8217;s Annual Report on Form&#160;10-K for the year ended December&#160;31, 2022 until September&#160;30, 2023, (ii)&#160;up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_cvrx_LineOfCreditDrawDownPeriodTwoMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_jfxhHaS2dUyb8qFbOmELng" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_ZoQCeTnDfkaH5ihxTvwHKw">30.0</ix:nonFraction> million less the amount funded from the first tranche between September&#160;1, 2023 and December&#160;15, 2023 if the Company achieves trailing three months revenue of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_cvrx_LineOfCreditDrawDownPeriodTwoMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_jfxhHaS2dUyb8qFbOmELng" decimals="-4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="cvrx:RevenueTreeMonthsTrailing" scale="6" id="Narr_fLUgde5CCkaRRwrtkinw4w">5.75</ix:nonFraction> million prior to June&#160;30, 2023, and (iii)&#160;up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_cvrx_LineOfCreditDrawDownPeriodThreeMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_sbvC-0pFu0Oi7pL0yKMtGQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_QNh3krf6yU6sq5vOe2qswQ">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million between September&#160;1, 2024 and December&#160;15, 2024 if the Company achieves trailing three months revenue of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_cvrx_LineOfCreditDrawDownPeriodThreeMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_sbvC-0pFu0Oi7pL0yKMtGQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="cvrx:RevenueTreeMonthsTrailing" scale="6" id="Narr_DYVBICvUkEm_6OYHYsKfeg">9.0</ix:nonFraction> million prior to June&#160;30, 2024. A performance covenant takes effect at the earlier of September&#160;30, 2025 or the third tranche funding requiring that the Company achieve <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_McnxRzCZsEioKvH21AiUWA" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2022_To_10_31_2022_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_9IiP3j4z8EWn_GxDWuKykg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="cvrx:PercentOfRevenueTarget" scale="-2" id="Narr_nEPhPXNh3UGFyq2IxWeg1A">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing twelve months revenue target set in the Board-approved revenue plan in effect for such period. The Loan Agreement requires the payment of certain penalties if the Term Loans are paid off prior to maturity for any reason, including pursuant to an acceleration clause, and includes various restrictive covenants, including a restriction on the payment of dividends or making other distributions or payments on the Company&#8217;s capital stock, subject to limited exceptions. The Company was in compliance with these covenants as of December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">In connection with the Loan Agreement, the Company recorded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_cvrx_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_cvrx_InnovatusLifeSciencesFundILpMember_7vW7J_Y6BUuPDKRDIyMSTw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredFinanceCostsGross" scale="6" id="Narr_LNHLyYG0bUyluFrgALd6rg">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million of debt issuance costs and discounts as a reduction of long-term debt. </p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:12pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">89</p></div></div>
