aseRemainingLeaseTerm" id="Narr__ve5BzlL_EWnZ9ahYEnN_Q">1.5</ix:nonNumeric> years, and the discount rate was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_McnxRzCZsEioKvH21AiUWA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_lUBxT6nrc0K-Jp4BGPCVnA" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseDiscountRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_QGgoVIu_C0S06t3IRnccuA">5.0</ix:nonFraction>%. The operating cash outflows from our operating lease were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_tofE_XZPmUi1m7ytubGWZQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="6" id="Narr_F9s-GvwBaUmcXJlryn6fHw">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million for the year ended December 31, 2022.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:12pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">90</p></div></div>
