k-based compensation arrangements was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_lUBxT6nrc0K-Jp4BGPCVnA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" scale="6" id="Narr__kcg37E96Uyrhpsig16oAQ">8.7</ix:nonFraction> million. As of December 31, 2022, the related weighted average period over which the expense is expected to be recognized is approximately <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_tofE_XZPmUi1m7ytubGWZQ" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_pXFK3EjfgUislX9KBL5toA">2.5</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Early exercise of stock options</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Under the 2001 Plan, the Company has issued options to certain executive officers with early-exercise provisions. The options may be exercised by the holder any time after they are granted. The Company has the right to repurchase, at the original option exercise price, shares issued pursuant to such early-exercise provisions, upon the termination of employment or death of the stockholder. This repurchase right expires based upon the original option vesting schedule. As of December 31, 2022 and 2021, there have been <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_spopxjEgKUytrOSPoGv7Cw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_cvrx_StockOptionsWithEarlyExerciseOptionMember_g-5lraLt3k6BT2bEezbYeA" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="3" id="Narr_ze3PTsbPdEiZuHP-ARgEiA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_spopxjEgKUytrOSPoGv7Cw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_cvrx_StockOptionsWithEarlyExerciseOptionMember_gJksuRON8kG1kgczS6c0vw" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="3" id="Narr_KwPF0IGnW0aaSlaIxhovnA">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> early exercises and therefore there is <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_cvrx_StockOptionsWithEarlyExerciseOptionMember__dPrthDMg0uXkH9_X2Dh3Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="cvrx:LiabilityRecordedForEarlyExerciseOfStockOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_2zDE5-6_60aOSabqS1EI1Q"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_uvc8ZF6Js0-z81tYLF8nVg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_cvrx_StockOptionsWithEarlyExerciseOptionMember_W2vncJmJOkK3neLqRhWo6g" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="cvrx:LiabilityRecordedForEarlyExerciseOfStockOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_CKhnuzbVUEeWAZ_kRLmoug">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> liability recorded for the early exercise of stock options.</p></ix:continuation><a id="_bbcd1f9a_28cc_4d64_a9ea_21f124c4b3f9"></a><a id="Tc_2kw8dLzPqUKgexkwy17-Aw_1_3"></a><a id="Tc_-d8gD9aYMUKkxU41FiVhfw_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_XK-t0BMI4kOIaKYUmPaBNQ_2_3"></a><a id="Tc_VpAd9y6P-06v-s9Yc5_V-Q_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_P8YpHchj2UKFzd2V5U2dbA_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_hDkSZSpz4UClt5CHcDPWDQ_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_Tpz1RM2fLUmpCzFVFFhCaA_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_OD-KawD1nUapAyiiTcG25A_4_5"></a><a id="Tc_QseymhLyoEOKKX8RfeoABg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_N1axT6zZeEijNLP7xhM0Dg_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_uEHlSj_JvU2AmlV-O2vzsA_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_EHIuzAahEEWyf3ZHSXoXNg_6_5"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_tofE_XZPmUi1m7ytubGWZQ" name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_sOD6FqCd70Cvd207tzJGpw" continuedAt="Tb_sOD6FqCd70Cvd207tzJGpw_cont1" escape="true"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0